{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify section called "Filter Removal Marquee" that looks similar to the reference image I provided.
    
    **Section Requirements:**
    - A full-width section with a light grey or off-white background (#FAFAFA or similar).
    - Add a **title** at the top: “Our Filters Remove…” centered and styled with bold dark blue text.
    - Below the title, create a **horizontal marquee slider** (continuously scrolling from right to left) that contains multiple **items**.
    
    Each marquee item should include:
    1. An **icon (image upload field)** at the top (centered).
    2. A **headline text** (for example: "Heavy Metals", "PFAs", "Microplastics").
    3. A **percentage text** below the headline (for example: "99.99%").
    4. Each icon/text item should be inside a small card with padding and spacing.
    
    Below the marquee section:
    - Add a **short text line**: “Still not convinced? Check out our third-party lab test reports, verified results with full transparency.”
    - Add a **button** next to or below that text labeled **“Lab Reports”**.
    - The button should allow me to **upload or link to a PDF file** and **trigger a file download** when clicked (e.g. when I upload a PDF in the section settings, clicking the button should download it).
    
    **Customization settings:**
    - Allow merchants to:
      - Add/edit marquee items (icon, title, percentage).
      - Adjust scroll speed and direction of marquee.
      - Change background color.
      - Add/change the section title and subtitle text.
      - Upload a PDF file for the “Lab Reports” button.
    
    **Design style:**
    - Clean, minimal, and modern.
    - Icons and text centered vertically.
    - Smooth marquee animation.
    - Button styled in dark blue with white text and rounded corners.
    
    This section should be mobile-friendly and fully responsive.
